          {
            "typeName": "notesText",
            "multiple": false,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "The file 'SURVEY RESULTS LEVERAGING.pdf' has been added June 1st, 2018.\n\nResearch in advance of the Seventeenth International Conference on Grey Literature held at the KNAW in Amsterdam on December 1-2, 2015\n\nThe GL17-S4P-Farace et al.pdf and GL17 Farace et al.xlsx file are supplied by GreyNet. Each tab/sheet of the GL17 Farace et al.xlsx file is also uploaded as a pdf file by DANS. The name of these files begin with GL17 Farace et al_tab."
